Open items (2026-10-06):

- `searchPaginationValidators` runs `.escape()` on the search term, which
  HTML-escapes it before it reaches the ILIKE query: searching for `a&b` looks
  for `a&amp;b`. Escape output at render time, not on the way into SQL.
- `ILIKE '%term%'` can't use a B-tree index. Add a pg_trgm GIN index or
  full-text search before the ticket table grows.
- Models are anemic (DTO interfaces) and the rules live in services; see
  docs/DESIGN.md. Decide whether role/ownership checks belong on a rich model.
- Read the user's role from the session/JWT (it can be up to 15 min stale for
  JWTs) or re-read it in `isActive` alongside account status.
